SUMMARY:Grave Concern: Historic Cemetery Preservation in Lancaster County
DESCRIPTION:Discover the hidden history right beneath our feet! Join Sam Me
 cum and Kenn Lefever from Grave Concern\, Inc. for an engaging look at the
  historic burial grounds of Lancaster County and Manheim Township. From fo
 rgotten family plots to recent preservation efforts at the Meister cemeter
 y near the Lancaster Airport\, learn how local historians protect these vi
 tal pieces of our community's heritage-- and what happens when modern deve
 lopment meets historic sites. Registration is encouraged!\n\nPrice: Free\n
